  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c0b2d3c355c504043abfb0e2fab534d9, type: 3}
  header: Shrine
  description: "Shrines change the room\u2019s state between Joy and Fear. You can
    bind the presents while the room is in the Joy state, allowing you to jump higher
    on them when it shifts to Fear. You can also bind doors and barriers open in
    the Fear state, allowing you to pass through them without the shadows when the
    room returns to Joy. Use these mechanics to clear a path for the train and ride
    it onward."
